    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2-\\frac54$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+x-1&=\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2-\\frac14-1\\\\x^2+x-1&=\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2-\\frac54.\\end{align*}$$",
